# leaf 7 EBX.5); and the top-level-array-sizing two-step bootstrap + a bug fix
# legitimately shows codegen-diff>0 with status-diff=0. cycc ~1,057,568 B,
# self_compile ~561 ms, check.sh 130 gates.
